### Get AAD access token
### client_id = the app requesting the token
### scope = the app validating the token, with /.default suffix for client credential flow
# @name tokenRequest
POST https://login.microsoftonline.com/<enter-your-tenant-id-here>/oauth2/v2.0/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=<enter-your-application-id-here>
&client_secret=<enter-your-client-secret-here>
&scope=https://<enter-your-application-id-here>/.default
&grant_type=client_credentials

###
GET http://localhost:8080/swagger/index.html#/

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/greetings
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRequest.response.body.$.access_token}}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/health/live

###
GET http://localhost:8080/health/ready